    "label": "传递函数的伯德形式是将传递函数表示为包含因子 (jωτ+1) 与 (jω/ω_n)^2 + 2ζ(jω/ω_n) + 1、增益 K_o 以及因子 (jω)^n 的形式，便于进行频率响应分析。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The Bode form of the transfer function is a representation where the transfer function is written in terms of factors (jωτ+1) and (jω/ω_n)^2 + 2ζ(jω/ω_n) + 1, with a gain K_o and a term (jω)^n, making it convenient for frequency response analysis.",
